  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 260,
      "end_ms": 3560,
      "text": "我们今天用一个非常朴素的道理来跟你讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 3560,
      "end_ms": 8210,
      "text": "就是说来讲点要经济经政治经济学啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 8210,
      "end_ms": 10120,
      "text": "它就叫涨薪"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 10860,
      "end_ms": 13220,
      "text": "涨薪本质上是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 13220,
      "end_ms": 15140,
      "text": "等于减租"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 15140,
      "end_ms": 16660,
      "text": "等于个人降租"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 16900,
      "end_ms": 18460,
      "text": "但是降租"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 21400,
      "end_ms": 23700,
      "text": "然后还有同时解答一个问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 23700,
      "end_ms": 26760,
      "text": "就是说其实我们再怎么节省"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 26760,
      "end_ms": 28470,
      "text": "你作为一个工薪阶层"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 28470,
      "end_ms": 29860,
      "text": "再怎么节省"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 30240,
      "end_ms": 33300,
      "text": "你还是一个高消费者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 33300,
      "end_ms": 35130,
      "text": "你还是个高消费者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 35130,
      "end_ms": 36690,
      "text": "无论你怎么省钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 36690,
      "end_ms": 38000,
      "text": "无论你怎么省"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 38000,
      "end_ms": 40239,
      "text": "你还是高消费者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 43280,
      "end_ms": 47059,
      "text": "再怎么省钱的工薪阶层也是高消费者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 49220,
      "end_ms": 51040,
      "text": "因为你的消费"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 51040,
      "end_ms": 54100,
      "text": "你的消费消费是为了什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 54100,
      "end_ms": 57390,
      "text": "维持消费的本质是用来什么再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 57390,
      "end_ms": 59610,
      "text": "这两种可能一个是再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 59610,
      "end_ms": 61590,
      "text": "还有一个是就是用来发展的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 61590,
      "end_ms": 62300,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 63400,
      "end_ms": 64920,
      "text": "用来发展自己的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 64920,
      "end_ms": 66060,
      "text": "提高自己的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 66060,
      "end_ms": 68880,
      "text": "提高自己的这个生产能力的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 70480,
      "end_ms": 73920,
      "text": "那么另外一部分消费它是用来再生产的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 73920,
      "end_ms": 75510,
      "text": "你的高消费里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 75510,
      "end_ms": 77810,
      "text": "无论你在这么省钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 77810,
      "end_ms": 79670,
      "text": "你还是用一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 79670,
      "end_ms": 80390,
      "text": "你是省不掉的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 80390,
      "end_ms": 83450,
      "text": "就是再生产主要分成几种啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 83450,
      "end_ms": 86210,
      "text": "一个就是比如说你的身体健康的再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 86210,
      "end_ms": 87450,
      "text": "体力再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 87450,
      "end_ms": 88950,
      "text": "体力的再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 90450,
      "end_ms": 92130,
      "text": "休息住房啊什么的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 92130,
      "end_ms": 94340,
      "text": "房租吃东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 94340,
      "end_ms": 96200,
      "text": "体质在身上健康的再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 96200,
      "end_ms": 98660,
      "text": "还有一个是你的脑力的再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 98660,
      "end_ms": 102130,
      "text": "脑力的再生产啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 102130,
      "end_ms": 103000,
      "text": "脑力在生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 103000,
      "end_ms": 104830,
      "text": "比如说你要刷刷抖音呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 104830,
      "end_ms": 107039,
      "text": "就买点小礼品呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 107100,
      "end_ms": 108360,
      "text": "买点新衣服"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 108360,
      "end_ms": 109020,
      "text": "新裤子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 109020,
      "end_ms": 111180,
      "text": "这东西看上去是一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 111180,
      "end_ms": 112560,
      "text": "当然还有一个是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 112560,
      "end_ms": 114030,
      "text": "最后一个社会关系再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 114030,
      "end_ms": 116179,
      "text": "社会关系的再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 118940,
      "end_ms": 121660,
      "text": "就是说比如说你买一个衣服"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 121660,
      "end_ms": 123340,
      "text": "买一个衣服啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 123340,
      "end_ms": 124480,
      "text": "你买一件衣服"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 124480,
      "end_ms": 125800,
      "text": "这衣服一保暖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 125800,
      "end_ms": 126940,
      "text": "它促进体力再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 126940,
      "end_ms": 128500,
      "text": "二好看脑力再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 128500,
      "end_ms": 130300,
      "text": "让你爱欲经济学爱欲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 130300,
      "end_ms": 133340,
      "text": "让你的这个情感和欲望恢复平衡"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 133340,
      "end_ms": 135800,
      "text": "三他是个社会关系再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 135800,
      "end_ms": 138860,
      "text": "它让你你买的衣服不要太寒碜太挫"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 138860,
      "end_ms": 142010,
      "text": "在同事里面穿的那个身衣服不像个人一样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 142010,
      "end_ms": 144350,
      "text": "他是体现你的社会地位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 144350,
      "end_ms": 148370,
      "text": "就是说让人家就愿意请你去他家做客"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 148370,
      "end_ms": 151040,
      "text": "人家就愿意是什么跟你交往"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 151040,
      "end_ms": 152840,
      "text": "你的社会关系再生产要靠"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 152840,
      "end_ms": 153620,
      "text": "就举个例子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 153620,
      "end_ms": 155150,
      "text": "就以衣服为例子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 155150,
      "end_ms": 158459,
      "text": "那么你这些在职场都要花钱的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 158459,
      "end_ms": 159119,
      "text": "我跟你讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 159119,
      "end_ms": 160600,
      "text": "有一个最重要的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 161300,
      "end_ms": 165160,
      "text": "他是高消费者里面消费最多的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 165160,
      "end_ms": 166240,
      "text": "就是你的社会关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 166240,
      "end_ms": 167660,
      "text": "再生产里面一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 167760,
      "end_ms": 171780,
      "text": "你要花钱来再生产你的什么一种社会关系啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 171780,
      "end_ms": 175700,
      "text": "你的你的岗位关系你的饭碗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 175700,
      "end_ms": 177890,
      "text": "你要再生产你的饭碗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 177890,
      "end_ms": 179400,
      "text": "什么意思呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 180140,
      "end_ms": 183940,
      "text": "你要交一定的份额的钱来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 183940,
      "end_ms": 186610,
      "text": "怎么样来保住你的这个职位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 186610,
      "end_ms": 188220,
      "text": "保住你的位置"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 189300,
      "end_ms": 190940,
      "text": "保住你的位置"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 190940,
      "end_ms": 192020,
      "text": "也就是说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 192020,
      "end_ms": 195780,
      "text": "这个钱实际上保住你位置的那个租金啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 195780,
      "end_ms": 197400,
      "text": "你你必须掏这笔租金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 197400,
      "end_ms": 200640,
      "text": "但是这个租金实际上它都是隐性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 200640,
      "end_ms": 201820,
      "text": "隐性租金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 201820,
      "end_ms": 204910,
      "text": "这个东西它在学术上有一个名称"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 204910,
      "end_ms": 208320,
      "text": "就是你你的生社会关系再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 208320,
      "end_ms": 210060,
      "text": "或者叫生产关系再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 210060,
      "end_ms": 211830,
      "text": "你的生产关系的再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 211830,
      "end_ms": 213450,
      "text": "让你支付的代价"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 213450,
      "end_ms": 215040,
      "text": "它是啥呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 215760,
      "end_ms": 221650,
      "text": "它的名字叫做sy j they啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 221650,
      "end_ms": 223450,
      "text": "它的名字叫SYJZ"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 223450,
      "end_ms": 226270,
      "text": "那么XYZ这一类的本质"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 226270,
      "end_ms": 228430,
      "text": "我们用一个很肤浅的话说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 228430,
      "end_ms": 230050,
      "text": "为什么他是不不公道的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 230050,
      "end_ms": 230650,
      "text": "不正义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 230650,
      "end_ms": 235540,
      "text": "因为它的本质就是你在这个生产岗位上的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 235540,
      "end_ms": 236440,
      "text": "这个岗位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 236440,
      "end_ms": 237860,
      "text": "你要交租"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 237980,
      "end_ms": 239240,
      "text": "你要交租"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 239240,
      "end_ms": 241209,
      "text": "只不过这个租子隐性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 241209,
      "end_ms": 242709,
      "text": "他要一个租"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 242709,
      "end_ms": 244089,
      "text": "把这个位置租给你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 244089,
      "end_ms": 245889,
      "text": "把这个生产岗位给你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 245889,
      "end_ms": 246909,
      "text": "给到你手上的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 246909,
      "end_ms": 249759,
      "text": "他肯定是一定要从你当中获利的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 249759,
      "end_ms": 251020,
      "text": "对不对啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 251020,
      "end_ms": 254380,
      "text": "那么这个被拿走的这部分就是租金啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 254380,
      "end_ms": 257560,
      "text": "这这个就是所以你是高消费者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 257560,
      "end_ms": 259950,
      "text": "是因为你要你的消费当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 259950,
      "end_ms": 262650,
      "text": "有一部分是是使得你本身"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 262650,
      "end_ms": 264390,
      "text": "你这个人本身要再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 264390,
      "end_ms": 266780,
      "text": "那你这个人就包含几个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 266800,
      "end_ms": 267760,
      "text": "体力再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 267760,
      "end_ms": 268960,
      "text": "脑力在社会关系再生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 268960,
      "end_ms": 271360,
      "text": "社会关系再生产里面一个生产关系的再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 271360,
      "end_ms": 274609,
      "text": "生产关系的再生产里面有一个最重要的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 274609,
      "end_ms": 275689,
      "text": "就是你的岗位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 275689,
      "end_ms": 276529,
      "text": "你的劳动岗位"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 276529,
      "end_ms": 279140,
      "text": "你的饭碗要再生产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 279300,
      "end_ms": 282360,
      "text": "那你每每那你赚的钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 282360,
      "end_ms": 285480,
      "text": "你如果你赚的总额是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 285480,
      "end_ms": 286260,
      "text": "不是更新啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 286260,
      "end_ms": 288300,
      "text": "就是说你创造了价值的总和"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 288300,
      "end_ms": 289560,
      "text": "你创造价值的总额"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 289560,
      "end_ms": 291230,
      "text": "比如说是1万元"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 291230,
      "end_ms": 294470,
      "text": "那你可能1万元里面就有3000块"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 294470,
      "end_ms": 296630,
      "text": "是用来交租子的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 296630,
      "end_ms": 298310,
      "text": "来包住你的饭碗的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 298310,
      "end_ms": 299870,
      "text": "是保住你的饭碗的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 299870,
      "end_ms": 303940,
      "text": "这个3000元它的学名叫SYJZ"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 303940,
      "end_ms": 307080,
      "text": "但是实际上你可以把它理解成叫做"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 307140,
      "end_ms": 309140,
      "text": "你的饭碗的租金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
